    "title": "Worcester Red Sox fall to Toledo Mud Hens, 4-1, with Seth Martinez pitching",
    "text": "Seth Martinez, a former Sunrise Mountain High School standout, took the mound for the Worcester Red Sox as they were defeated 4-1 by the Toledo Mud Hens in their MiLB contest at 6:45 p.m. on Tuesday, June 23.\nThe teams faced off at Polar Park in what was their season’s first meeting.\nMartinez pitched 1.2 innings during the game.\nWorcester is set to play again on Wednesday, June 24, at Polar Park, taking on the Worcester Red Sox.",
